   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Brainstem — the one surface you talk to\nYour own AI: frozen Grail kernel · hot-loaded agents · soul · memory\nkernel: LTS brainstem-v0.6.9 (RAPP’s pin) · newest tag brainstem-v0.6.16\nIts Hive agent proposes; you decide. A Hive is never its agents folder or soul.\nHome: kody-w/RAPP, with the LTS kernel pinned to\nkody-w/rapp-installer@brainstem-v0.6.9",
