   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Estate — an owner’s signed registry\nWho may sign as whom · which protocols are pinned · which Grail kernel each release scope pins\nAppend-only · rappid.json · a signed registry · an owner anchor out of band\nHome: Each owner’s repository (rappid.json, registry.json); the kody-w estate’s signed registry is ecosystem-spec.json in\nkody-w/rapp-map, anchored by the owner rappid in kody-w/rapp-1’s README",
   "originalText": "Estate — an owner’s signed registry\nWho may sign as whom · which protocols are pinned · which Grail kernel each release scope pins\nAppend-only · rappid.json · a signed registry · an owner anchor out of band\nHome: Each owner’s repository (rappid.json, registry.json); the kody-w estate’s signed registry is ecosystem-spec.json in\nkody-w/rapp-map, anchored by the owner rappid in kody-w/rapp-1’s README",
